    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30518" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nauportum</span></b> , i, n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city in Upper
				Pannonia</i>, the mod. <i>Laybach</i>, <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 1,
			20</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vell. 2, 110, 4</span></i>.—Near it is
			the river <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nau-portus</span></b> ,
			i, m., <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 18,
				22, § 128</span></i>.</div>
